{"id":"f1ca4420af66074c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-exact-pair.md","title":"精确对定理","display":"thm-exact-pair — 精确对定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-exact-pair","aliases":["20-thm-exact-pair"],"display":"thm-exact-pair — 精确对定理","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.5.3","source_printed_pages":[142,143,144],"source_pdf_pages":[176,177,178],"depends_on":["[[20-df-exact-pair]]","[[20-df-column-thickness]]","[[20-df-partial-compatibility]]","[[20-lem-compatible-cross-search]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-deg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-exact-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-exact-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-exact-pair — 精确对定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.5.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span><span>143</span><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span><span>177</span><span>178</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3453e924fc352c67\" href=\"?note=3453e924fc352c67\" title=\"20-df-exact-pair\">20-df-exact-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b726984ad897f45b\" href=\"?note=b726984ad897f45b\" title=\"20-df-column-thickness\">20-df-column-thickness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8cea21e174a04417\" href=\"?note=8cea21e174a04417\" title=\"20-df-partial-compatibility\">20-df-partial-compatibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ff58133a4b24edeb\" href=\"?note=ff58133a4b24edeb\" title=\"20-lem-compatible-cross-search\">20-lem-compatible-cross-search</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf a_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\((\\mathbf a_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为递增 Turing 度序列，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\ [\\mathbf a_n\\le\\mathbf a_{n+1}]\">\\(\\forall n\\ [\\mathbf a_n\\le\\mathbf a_{n+1}]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3453e924fc352c67\" href=\"?note=3453e924fc352c67\" title=\"20-df-exact-pair\">20-df-exact-pair</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b726984ad897f45b\" href=\"?note=b726984ad897f45b\" title=\"20-df-column-thickness\">20-df-column-thickness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8cea21e174a04417\" href=\"?note=8cea21e174a04417\" title=\"20-df-partial-compatibility\">20-df-partial-compatibility</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ff58133a4b24edeb\" href=\"?note=ff58133a4b24edeb\" title=\"20-lem-compatible-cross-search\">20-lem-compatible-cross-search</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c98b19cc764c238f\" href=\"?note=c98b19cc764c238f\" title=\"20-df-deg\">20-df-deg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}exact\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\operatorname{ExactPair}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c;(\\mathbf a_n))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}exact\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\operatorname{ExactPair}(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c;(\\mathbf a_n))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n\\in\\mathbf a_n\">\\(A_n\\in\\mathbf a_n\\)</span>，以第一坐标为列号组成矩阵。构造两条增长的偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_s,\\psi_s\">\\(\\theta_s,\\psi_s\\)</span>：阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 时它们在全部列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;s\">\\(n&lt;s\\)</span> 上已完全定义，并与相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n\">\\(A_n\\)</span> 各只差有限位；在其余列只规定有限信息。</p>\n<p>第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 步处理有效排列中的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 个指标对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,i)\">\\((e,i)\\)</span>。若有有限串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\tau\">\\(\\rho,\\tau\\)</span>，分别与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_s,\\psi_s\">\\(\\theta_s,\\psi_s\\)</span> 相容，且某输入上停止输出不同，则按固定有效顺序选第一个见证，并将它们分别并入偏函数。若无则保持不动。然后把第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 列的全部未定位置按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 填完，保留此前有限例外。这维护上述不变量。所有列最终完全定义，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n\">\\(A_n\\)</span> 与两边对应列有限不同，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a_n\\le\\deg_T(B),\\deg_T(C)\">\\(\\mathbf a_n\\le\\deg_T(B),\\deg_T(C)\\)</span>。所用的是按列有限相等，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\">\\(B,C\\)</span> 是目标矩阵的子集。</p>\n<p>验证精确性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\le_TB,C\">\\(D\\le_TB,C\\)</span>，取指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,i\">\\(e,i\\)</span> 计算共同全输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_D\">\\(\\chi_D\\)</span>。处理这个指标对时不可能找到不同见证，否则有限 use 将把不同永久保存到真实输出中。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_s,\\psi_s\">\\(\\theta_s,\\psi_s\\)</span> 的定义域、值都可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_s=\\bigoplus_{n&lt;s}A_n\">\\(Z_s=\\bigoplus_{n&lt;s}A_n\\)</span> 配合有限例外计算：列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;s\">\\(&lt;s\\)</span> 已填满且仅有限不同，其他列只有有限已规定位。相容搜索引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\le_TZ_s\">\\(D\\le_TZ_s\\)</span>。递增性又使有限 join <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_s\\le_TA_s\">\\(Z_s\\le_TA_s\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=0\">\\(s=0\\)</span> 时它是空集合），所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_T(D)\\le\\mathbf a_s\">\\(\\deg_T(D)\\le\\mathbf a_s\\)</span>，这正是精确对条件。</p>\n<p>本存在性构造允许在每阶段对否定的延伸问题作数学分支选择，不声称序列统一可计算，也不声称其输出有无条件的普通可计算界。校正原稿过宽源页区间为实际定理及证明 142–144。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.5.3；印刷页 142, 143, 144；PDF 第 176, 177, 178 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-exact-pair","status":"resolved","id":"3453e924fc352c67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-exact-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-column-thickness","status":"resolved","id":"b726984ad897f45b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-column-thickness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-compatibility","status":"resolved","id":"8cea21e174a04417","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-compatibility]]","embed":false},{"target":